# Go Nuts!: "Teamwork 3 ... Choose one. If this spell was cast using teamwork, choose both instead." Bot1 taps its Centaur Courser
# (power 3, exactly the total needed) and so chooses both modes: the +1/+1 counter goes on the Courser (4/4) first (printed order,
# CR 700.2d), then it fights Bot2's Grizzly Bears: the Courser deals 4 and the Bears die, the Bears deal 2 to it.

